<p><m>\qquad y =</m><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert> (B) </alert>
Line satisfying <m>y(3) = 1</m> and <m>y(-4) = 2</m>.</p>
<p><m>\qquad y =</m><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
